{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scgpt RNA encoder in a multiprofile setup with transformer aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.5136 and F1 of 0.4982. These results suggest scgpt underperforms compared to the scvi_n200 baseline in multiprofile configurations. Uncertainty remains about the relative impact of encoder architecture versus other factors, as no direct comparisons to alternative encoders or fusion strategies were conducted."
}

